  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability and environment aid roadmap for the private sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This umbrella project contemplates two lines of action: 
1) increase climate change awareness and  environmental protection in SMEs&#x2019; operations and,
2) Map opportunities for local content in the value chain of production technologies for the use of green hydrogen in Mexico, to raise awareness among SMEs about the relevance of incorporating the sustainable development approach and the 2030 Agenda vision to their business activities. 

The project will allow to raise awareness among Mexican SMEs about the relevance of incorporating the sustainable development approach (and its three dimensions: social inclusion, economic growth, and environmental protection, considering effective governance schemes) and the 2030 Agenda vision to their business activities and to  identify opportunity areas for the private sector to introduce national content and use of green hydrogen in the value chain of production technologies and the possible impact that they could generate in other industries.</narrative>
  </description>
